Subject: [PATCH 09/11] feat(langgraph): HITLInterrupt class + tests

LangGraph-native HITL using interrupt() / Command(resume=...).
Budget-aware threshold gating, node boundary wrapping, tool boundary
wrapping, and parse_resume_value helper.
